flowchart TB
  subgraph AUTH[Authoritative plane]
    ST[DATA-009 Workflow State]
    EV[Authorized evidence sources]
    HD[CMP-006 human decision references]
  end
  subgraph DERIVED[Derived context plane]
    RP[DATA-079 Regeneration Plan]
    CS[DATA-080 Context Snapshot]
  end
  subgraph MEMORY[Optional continuity memory]
    CG[DATA-082 Consent Grant]
    MR[DATA-081 Case Working Memory]
  end
  ST --> RP
  EV --> RP
  HD --> RP
  RP --> CS
  CG --> MR
  CS --> MR
  MR -. stale / optional input .-> RP
  ST -- always wins conflicts --> RP
  MR -. never authorizes .-> ST
